msgid "Orders your familiar to use <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Stone Gaze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, dealing unaspected damage with a potency of 750.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Afflicts target with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Petrification</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 42s<br><if ($gn68 == 43)><if ($gn72 >= 44)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lingering Vantage</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 60s<br></if></if>Can only be executed while in combat and under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>One with Nature</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
